# WordPress.org submission material — deliberately NOT in this repo.
#
# This repository is public and is what store owners are pointed at to download
# the plugin, so the directory listing's assets (icon, banner, admin-panel
# screenshots) and the internal submission runbook do not belong in it. They are
# kept locally and copied straight into the SVN checkout's assets/ directory at
# release time.
#
# readme.txt is intentionally NOT listed here: it is part of the plugin
# distribution itself (it ships inside the ZIP and in SVN trunk/), so it stays
# versioned.
